{
    "title": "Budget Car Rental",
    "description": "Discover a better rental car experience with the new Budget app. With 3,000 locations in 120 countries, we are one of the world's best-known car rental companies.  Whether traveling for family vacation, weekend getaway or business we know you want to get on the road as quickly as possible. The Budget app makes renting a car simple, speedy, and hassle-free with control of your journey from start to finish in the palm of your hands.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nLowest Car Rental Prices*: Access exclusive in-app rates when you log in. \r\nSeamless Reservations: Find and reserve a car in a few simple steps. Choose from a wide range of vehicles, including SUVs, minivans, trucks, compact cars, and more options to suit your needs and budget.\r\nManage Your Booking: Easily view, modify, or cancel your car rental directly from the app. Keep track of your rental details and upcoming trips all in one place.\r\nContactless Rentals: Skip the line and go straight to your car with Budget Fastbreak**. Enjoy a seamless travel experience with our contactless rental options. Expedite your check out and earn Budget Bucks on eligible rentals.\r\n24/7 Dedicated Support: Get assistance whenever you need it with our dedicated customer service team. We\u2019re here to help you every step of the way.\r\nRoadside Assistance: If you experience trouble on the road, contact roadside assistance directly from the app.\r\nLocation Finder: Find the nearest Budget location with ease. Use the app to get directions, phone numbers, hours of operation, and available vehicle options. \r\nThousands of Locations: Select your car rental from one, or more, of our airport and city locations across the globe.\r\n\r\nFor access to the lowest prices, the shortest wait, and dedicated customer service, download the new Budget car rental app today. Because you\u2019ve got places to be.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\n\r\nPhone: 1.888.841.0849\r\nEmail: budgetapp@avisbudget.com\r\n\r\n*Terms & Conditions apply. Visit budget.com/bestprice for details.\r\n**Available at select locations and identity verification required on first Fastbreak rental. See\r\nbudget.com/en/loyalty-profile/fastbreak for details.\r\n \r\nBy tapping the Install button or by downloading the Budget App published by Budget Rent A Car System, Inc. you consent to the installation of the Budget App and to its future updates and upgrades. You can withdraw your consent at any time by uninstalling the app. To request assistance with the removal or disabling of the Budget App, please contact us.\r\n\r\nYou acknowledge and understand and agree that the Budget App (including any updates or upgrades) may cause your device to automatically communicate with Budget\u2019s servers to deliver the functionality described above and to record location-based information and usage metrics, (ii) affect app-related preferences or data stored in your device, and (iii) collect personal information as set out in our Privacy Notice at budget.com/privacy and in the Budget App Terms of Use at budget.com/mobiletou. The Budget App delivers push notifications. You may turn push notifications off in the \u201cPreferences\u201d tab.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover a better rental car experience with the new Budget app. With 3,000 locations in 120 countries, we are one of the world&#39;s best-known car rental companies.  Whether traveling for family vacation, weekend getaway or business we know you want to get on the road as quickly as possible. The Budget app makes renting a car simple, speedy, and hassle-free with control of your journey from start to finish in the palm of your hands.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>Lowest Car Rental Prices*: Access exclusive in-app rates when you log in. <br>Seamless Reservations: Find and reserve a car in a few simple steps. Choose from a wide range of vehicles, including SUVs, minivans, trucks, compact cars, and more options to suit your needs and budget.<br>Manage Your Booking: Easily view, modify, or cancel your car rental directly from the app. Keep track of your rental details and upcoming trips all in one place.<br>Contactless Rentals: Skip the line and go straight to your car with Budget Fastbreak**. Enjoy a seamless travel experience with our contactless rental options. Expedite your check out and earn Budget Bucks on eligible rentals.<br>24/7 Dedicated Support: Get assistance whenever you need it with our dedicated customer service team. We\u2019re here to help you every step of the way.<br>Roadside Assistance: If you experience trouble on the road, contact roadside assistance directly from the app.<br>Location Finder: Find the nearest Budget location with ease. Use the app to get directions, phone numbers, hours of operation, and available vehicle options. <br>Thousands of Locations: Select your car rental from one, or more, of our airport and city locations across the globe.<br><br>For access to the lowest prices, the shortest wait, and dedicated customer service, download the new Budget car rental app today. Because you\u2019ve got places to be.<br><br>Contact us:<br><br>Phone: 1.888.841.0849<br>Email: budgetapp@avisbudget.com<br><br>*Terms &amp; Co